## # three VMs, two of which are on the same node
## vm config filesystem /root/uminicccfs
## vm config net LAN
## vm config schedule mm1
## vm launch container vm-a
## vm config schedule mm1
## vm launch container vm-b
## vm config schedule mm2
## vm launch container vm-c
## vm start all

## .annotate true .column name vm info
host | name
mm1  | vm-a
mm1  | vm-b
mm2  | vm-c

## # should not work
## tap mirror vm-a 0 vm-c 0
E: vms are not colocated or invalid vm name: vm-a
E: vms are not colocated or invalid vm name: vm-c

## # should work
## tap mirror vm-a 0 vm-b 0

## # clear by destination
## clear tap mirror vm-b 0

## # already cleared, should have error
## clear tap mirror vm-b 0
E: not a valid mirror
